	(text "XA: U2 25 MHz TCXO, R4 10R feed, R13 0R OE (DNP),\nC12 100n to XA; XB open.\nJ16 CLKIN (10-100 MHz): R43 49.9R termination,\nD21 PESD5V0F1BL ESD, C54 100n AC coupling,\nR44/R45 10k/10k bias at VDD/2.\nOEB tied to GND; outputs enabled over I2C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 78.74 0)
