	(text "U1 TPS61085: +5V to 12 V.\nFREQ high (1.2 MHz),\nEN tied to +5V.\nVout = 1.238 x (1+R80/R81)\n     = 11.98 V.\nR82 33k/C55 1n: comp (TI eq. 9).\nC56: soft-start (100n, ~5 ms).\nL1 4.7u MWSA0503S (Isat 4.6 A), D22 B5819W.\nC2 10u in, C3+C57 out.\nFeeds Q2 AO3407A switch."
